---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import logoImage from "../assets/logo-wealthy-waves.webp";
---

<footer class="bg-[#0a0a0c] pt-24 pb-12 px-6 border-t border-white/5">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-12 mb-16">
    <div class="col-span-1 md:col-span-2">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
        <Image
          src={logoImage}
          alt="Wealthy Waves"
          width={160}
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
          class="h-10 md:h-12 w-auto object-contain"
        />
        <span class="font-display font-bold text-xl text-white"
          >Wealthy Waves</span
        >
      </div>
      <p class="text-white/50 text-sm max-w-sm">
        Menyatukan mobilitas, kreativitas, dan solusi branding.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h4 class="font-bold mb-6">Divisi</h4>
      <ul class="space-y-4 text-white/50 text-sm">
